# Backend origin for production builds (no trailing slash). Leave unset for local development:
# the Vite dev server proxies /api and /health to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# VITE_API_URL=https://fraudshield-api.onrender.com
#
# Never put an API key in a VITE_ variable: everything prefixed VITE_ is published in the JavaScript bundle.
